    "meaning": "Your gold beacon on the night globe, with hostile threads arriving from every side of the world. In the show a fighter feels a hostile ki from across the planet; Ki feels every attack land on your sensors. Thread colours are the attacker classes: ember for miners, bone for bots, teal for humans.",
